'''Alexander''' is a male [[Pixies|pixie]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] [[Merchants|merchant]] that can be found near the [[Lakeshore]] [[Cooking Table]]. He sells [[Warrior]] [[Jobs|Job]] related [[Items|items]].

==Sells==
*[[Charge Attack Warrior Pauldrons]]
*[[Charge Attack Warrior Breeches]]
*[[Charge Attack Warrior Helm]]
*[[Charge Attack Warrior Gauntlets]]
*[[Charge Attack Warrior Hightops]]
*[[Charge Attack Warrior Tunic]]
*[[Warrior's Power Shard of Regeneration III]]
*[[Warrior's Ring of Energy III]]
*[[Warrior's Necklace of Bark Skin III]]
*[[Warrior's Battle Hammer of Whirlwind]]
*[[Warrior's Battle Hammer of Earthquake]]
*[[Warrior's Battle Hammer of Spinning]]

==Trivia==
*Alexander was introduced in-game on the update of October 1, 2013.
